    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***CASH ONLY***\r\n\r\nPORTFOLIO OF 5 APARTMENTS\r\n\r\nPrime location: \r\nSuperbly located in the heart of Shannon Town Centre, Brú na Sionna offers unparalleled convenience, positioned adjacent to The Library, SkyCourt Shopping Centre, and Shannon Town Park. This prime location provides immediate access to a wide range of local amenities including shops, schools, recreational facilities, and major employment hubs such as Shannon Industrial Estate.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis unique opportunity consists of a portfolio of 5 apartments within Brú na Shionna.  The portfolio includes,  a mixture of 2- and 3-bedroom units, all fully let. Current rents range from €1,064 to €1,389 per month, generating a combined gross rent roll of €70,020 per annum.\r\n\r\nThe development offers a blend of spacious layouts and desirable  living, making it an attractive prospect for investors seeking strong rental income in a prime location.\r\n\r\nAll apartments finished with a mix of tiled/carpeted/laminate flooring, fitted kitchen units together with plastered and painted walls."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Salto Fob Access\r\n-Electric Heating\r\n-Car Spaces\r\n-Potential Return €110,000 p.a\r\n\r\nBER Rang B1/D1\r\nBER Certificates available on request"
      },
      {
